==Russian==

===Etymology===
{{af|ru|по-|роди́ть}}

===Pronunciation===
* {{ru-IPA|породи́ть}}
* {{audio|ru|Ru-породить.ogg}}

===Verb===
{{ru-verb|породи́ть|pf|impf=порожда́ть}}

# to [[beget]], to [[cause]], to [[entail]], to [[generate]]
# to [[engender]], to [[give rise]]
# ''(obsolete)'' to [[give birth]]

====Usage notes====
In modern speech, this verb is only used figuratively in reference to abstract ideas or concepts. (E.g. Успех породил зависть.) For physical, biological birth, see [[родить]]. 

====Conjugation====
{{ru-conj|pf|4b+pжд|породи́ть}}

====Related terms====
* {{l|ru|порожде́ние}}
* {{l|ru|рожа́ть}}
* {{l|ru|рожда́ть}}
